{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Entity Framework Core Entity.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Entity Framework Core Entity.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"entity framework core entity entity framework core entity","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Entity Framework Core Entity.md","fileName":"Entity Framework Core Entity.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Entity Framework Core Entity","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-06 20:34\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Entity Framework Core Data Modeling]] [[Entity Framework Core Data Access]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Entity Framework Core Data Modeling","Entity Framework Core Data Access","Data Transfer Object","hands-onobject-orientedprogrammingwithc.pdf","aspnetcore3andangular9_3ed.pdf","c80andnetcore30moderncross-platformdevelopment.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Entity Framework Core Entity.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Entity Framework Core Entity.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"entity framework core entity entity framework core entity","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Entity Framework Core Entity.md","fileName":"Entity Framework Core Entity.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Entity Framework Core Entity","heading":"Entity Framework Core Entity","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"An Entity Framework Core entity is a typed class representing persistent, code-driven data in an application model. Its properties describe stored values, keys, and navigation relationships that the mapper associates with database structures.\n\nEntity classes let a controller work with domain objects instead of raw rows. They should not automatically become the public API shape; a [[Data Transfer Object]] can expose only the values that a client needs.\n\nEntity properties can be scalar values mapp